Package: speccal
Title: Calibrated Inference for Specification Curve Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Peng", "Huang", , "hp@zjkq.com.cn", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Rui", "Zhang", , "zhangrui46@zju.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cph")))
Description: Inference and calibration layer for specification curve
    (multiverse) analysis: survey-design grid fitting, Freedman-Lane
    permutation nulls, a null-based criterion for defensible
    specifications, calibrated summaries and variance decomposition, a
    constraint test for composite indices, and boundary diagnostics for
    breakpoints.
